+| PS4 | 8× AMD Jaguar x86-64 | AMD GCN, 18 CUs | shadPS4 v0.21 | **N/A** (code is native x86-64); bbport runs Bloodborne natively | GCN ISA → SPIR-V; PM4 command streams → Vulkan |
